slider182:0<0,21,1{Off,1/64T,1/64,1/32T,1/64.,1/32,1/16T,1/32.,1/16,1/8T,1/16.,1/8,1/4T,1/8.,1/4,1/2T,1/4.,1/2,1/1T,1/2.,1/1,1/1.}>-B14 Release sync
