slider188:0.7071<0.1,40,0.0001:log>-B15 Q
slider189:1<0,19,1{6,12,18,24,30,36,42,48,54,60,66,72,78,84,90,96,102,108,114,120}>-B15 Slope (dB/oct)
slider190:-24<-80,0,0.1>-B15 Threshold (dB)
