slider221:qz_native=0<0,1,1>-Native look (internal; the THEME panel's NATIVE row; arrives with the face)
slider222:qz_in_db=0<-30,30,0.01>-Input (dB)
slider223:qz_look=0<0,3,1{Off,1 ms,5 ms,10 ms}>-Dynamics lookahead
